        <Paragraphs>
          <Paragraph>
            <TextRuns>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>Any objection to the above data, shall be informed by the latest five (5) working days via email to collection.groupaskes@bni-life.co.id (premium invoice) and collection.eksesklaim@bni-life.co.id (excess invoice) or fax (021 ) 29539998 or phone (021) 29539999 Ext. 3424  Attn:  Mr. Toha Husen (premium invoice) and Ext. 3423 Attn: Ms. Ningrum Wulansari (excess invoice).</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Italic</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily>
